[#4471](/kb/incidents/4471) was merged on subject lines ([decision 0001](/kb/decisions/0001-dedupe-by-subject))
and marked known: one bug, one fix queued. Read by tenant and by way in, its reports are three
problems. The queued parser fix closes only the first.

<Callout kind="warn">
Not one issue. Each problem below has its own ticket; fixing one does not fix the others.
</Callout>

## What #4471 holds

<ProblemTable
  ticket={4471}
  filed={{
    parser: 'https://github.com/blazejszuca/mega.dev.test/issues/1',
